OL,3,GLondon & Southeast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith a good deal of cloud at first.
OL,7,FCloud breaks developing in the
OL,8,Fevening, with the north-easterly winds
OL,9,Fbringing colder temperatures, and
OL,10,Ffrost likely in many places outside of
OL,11,FLondon. Minimum Temperature -2C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FDry but dull to start, though
OL,14,Fsome showers may move in from the
OL,15,Fnorth late in the afternoon. Mostly
OL,16,Flight winds, though stronger along the
OL,17,Fcoast. Frost possible overnight.
OL,18,FMaximum Temperature 6C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
